<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">owari wa shinai</font></b></font></font>

26
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:13,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">To the distant light above,</font></b></font></font>

27
00:01:13,940 --> 00:01:17,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">ON THE WAY</font></b></font></font>

28
00:01:13,940 --> 00:01:17,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">yes, we are on the way!</font></b></font></font>

29
00:01:21,850 --> 00:01:28,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I WANNA ROCKS mune ni ROCKS</font></b></font></font>

30
00:01:21,850 --> 00:01:28,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I wanna rock... Rockin' my heart...</font></b></font></font>

31
00:01:32,570 --> 00:01:34,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this the first time you
have faced a friend's death?</font>

32
00:01:36,450 --> 00:01:38,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the way of the Shinobi...</font>

33
00:01:43,790 --> 00:01:45,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't forgive you...</font>

34
00:02:05,310 --> 00:02:06,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to kill you!</font>

35
00:02:31,250 --> 00:02:37,260
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The White Past</font>

36
00:02:31,250 --> 00:02:37,260
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Secret Feelings</font>

37
00:02:43,430 --> 00:02:44,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's murder in his eyes!</font>

38
00:02:45,060 --> 00:02:47,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He looks nothing like he used to!</font>

39
00:02:49,230 --> 00:02:49,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's coming!</font>

40
00:02:54,860 --> 00:02:55,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

41
00:02:57,940 --> 00:02:59,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His Chakra repelled my attack!</font>

42
00:03:00,450 --> 00:03:01,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then...</font>

43
00:03:13,580 --> 00:03:14,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This should do it!</font>

44
00:03:20,630 --> 00:03:21,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?!</font>

45
00:03:26,100 --> 00:03:26,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be!</font>

46
00:03:33,190 --> 00:03:35,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could... Naruto's seal
have been broken...?!</font>

47
00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:38,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No.</font>

48
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:39,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This feeling...</font>

49
00:03:40,700 --> 00:03:42,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">True, the seal is almost off</font>

50
00:03:42,740 --> 00:03:45,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the Chakra of the Nine-Tailed
Fox Spirit is escaping, but...</font>

51
00:03:47,870 --> 00:03:50,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fortunately, the seal is not
completely broken!</font>

52
00:03:53,210 --> 00:03:54,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I still have some time!</font>

53
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you hear me, Zabuza?</font>

54
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:00,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're both busy people.</font>

55
00:04:01,170 --> 00:04:03,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know it's against your style,</font>

56
00:04:03,590 --> 00:04:06,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I think it's about time
we stopped playing around.</font>

57
00:04:09,430 --> 00:04:11,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't we settle this once
and for all with the next move?</font>

58
00:04:12,480 --> 00:04:13,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Interesting.</font>

59
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:17,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What can you possibly
do in this situation?</font>

60
00:04:17,610 --> 00:04:20,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi, go ahead.
Show me.</font>

61
00:04:26,990 --> 00:04:27,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No good...</font>

62
00:04:27,910 --> 00:04:30,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't hold his aura down!</font>

63
00:05:17,830 --> 00:05:18,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zabuza-san...</font>

64
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:25,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't defeat this boy.</font>

65
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:29,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zabuza-san...</font>

66
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm...</font>

67
00:06:04,090 --> 00:06:06,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... from that time...</font>

68
00:06:09,050 --> 00:06:09,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?</font>

69
00:06:10,140 --> 00:06:11,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why stop?</font>

70
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:18,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though I killed your dear friend,
you can't kill me?</font>

71
00:06:27,610 --> 00:06:28,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

72
00:06:36,700 --> 00:06:39,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened to the
force from moment ago?</font>

73
00:06:39,830 --> 00:06:44,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't defeat me with
that kind of strength.</font>

74
00:06:46,010 --> 00:06:49,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wasn't he someone
special to you?</font>

75
00:06:51,180 --> 00:06:54,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is there someone special
in your life?</font>

76
00:06:55,310 --> 00:06:57,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to protect someone
special to me.</font>

77
00:06:58,230 --> 00:07:00,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to make that
person's dream a reality...</font>

78
00:07:01,190 --> 00:07:02,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my dream.</font>

79
00:07:04,610 --> 00:07:08,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Many people misunderstand.</font>

80
00:07:09,400 --> 00:07:12,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They pity and don't finish off
the enemy they ought to finish.</font>

81
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:15,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They let them survive.</font>

82
00:07:16,870 --> 00:07:21,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To me, that isn't compassion
or anything.</font>

83
00:07:23,460 --> 00:07:24,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you know?</font>

84
00:07:25,290 --> 00:07:28,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How it feels to
not be needed by anyone?</font>

85
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:32,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To live day to day without a dream.
The pain of it all.</font>

86
00:07:33,430 --> 00:07:34,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying?</font>

87
00:07:35,510 --> 00:07:39,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zabuza-san has no use
for a weak Shinobi.</font>

88
00:07:40,020 --> 00:07:43,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You took away
my reason for existence.</font>

89
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:45,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?</font>

90
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:47,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do you have to
serve a guy like that?</font>

91
00:07:47,610 --> 00:07:51,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He gets the money from thugs
to do bad things!</font>

92
00:07:52,110 --> 00:07:56,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that No-Brow
the only person special to you?</font>

93
00:07:58,490 --> 00:08:02,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A long time ago,
I had other people special to me.</font>

94
00:08:04,170 --> 00:08:07,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They were... my parents.</font>

95
00:08:10,510 --> 00:08:16,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was born in the Land of Water,
in a small village heavy with snow.</font>

96
00:08:18,060 --> 00:08:19,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My parents worked on a small farm.</font>

97
00:08:19,930 --> 00:08:22,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were very poor,</font>

98
00:08:22,440 --> 00:08:25,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but my parents seem to
be satisfied with it.</font>

99
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:29,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was happy then...</font>

100
00:08:29,570 --> 00:08:31,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They were loving parents.</font>

101
00:08:34,410 --> 00:08:35,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

102
00:08:36,070 --> 00:08:38,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I was old enough
to understand things,</font>

103
00:08:38,950 --> 00:08:40,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">something happened.</font>

104
00:08:41,370 --> 00:08:42,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something?</font>

105
00:08:42,790 --> 00:08:44,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened?</font>

106
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:52,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My blood...</font>

107
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:53,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Blood?</font>

108
00:08:56,300 --> 00:08:57,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go on!</font>

109
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:59,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tell me what happened.</font>

110
00:09:02,100 --> 00:09:04,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My father...
He killed my mother.</font>

111
00:09:05,140 --> 00:09:07,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then he tried to kill me.</font>

112
00:09:07,690 --> 00:09:08,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

113
00:09:11,110 --> 00:09:14,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After the experience of
the ceaseless civil war,</font>

114
00:09:14,650 --> 00:09:18,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">people with Kekkei Genkai were
hated and feared in the Land of Water.</font>

115
00:09:19,450 --> 00:09:21,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kekkei Genkai?</font>

116
00:09:21,910 --> 00:09:25,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's special powers or Jutsu
passed on through certain clans,</font>

117
00:09:25,870 --> 00:09:31,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from parent to child,
or from grandparent to grandchild.</font>

118
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:34,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because of their special powers,</font>

119
00:09:35,130 --> 00:09:39,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">those of the clans were exploited in
all sorts of battles.</font>

120
00:09:39,220 --> 00:09:41,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As a result, all Kekkei Genkai
were feared</font>

121
00:09:41,930 --> 00:09:44,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as harbingers of disaster
and death.</font>

122
00:09:49,310 --> 00:09:50,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After the war was over,</font>

123
00:09:50,610 --> 00:09:55,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they decided to hide
their special powers.</font>

124
00:09:56,450 --> 00:10:01,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If anyone knew of their secret,
only death could be expected.</font>

125
00:10:03,040 --> 00:10:07,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sure that boy went through
so much suffering as well.</font>

126
00:10:07,920 --> 00:10:11,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The greater your power,
the more you were feared.</font>

127
00:10:13,800 --> 00:10:17,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My mother had the Kekkei Genkai.</font>

128
00:10:18,130 --> 00:10:20,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She kept it secret from my father.</font>

129
00:10:21,140 --> 00:10:22,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She hoped that for a while...</font>

130
00:10:22,640 --> 00:10:27,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, she must have thought that
they could have a simple life forever.</font>

131
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:35,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look, Mommy! Look!</font>

132
00:10:36,900 --> 00:10:38,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it fantastic?</font>

133
00:10:41,410 --> 00:10:42,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not you, too!</font>

134
00:10:42,910 --> 00:10:44,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why? Why him, too?</font>

135
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:46,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That hurts, Mommy!</font>

136
00:10:52,380 --> 00:10:53,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry...</font>

137
00:10:53,500 --> 00:10:56,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, Haku...</font>

138
00:10:57,380 --> 00:10:58,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry!</font>

139
00:11:01,180 --> 00:11:02,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

140
00:11:02,510 --> 00:11:06,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father had discovered our secret.</font>

141
00:12:06,910 --> 00:12:08,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I came to...</font>

142
00:12:08,620 --> 00:12:11,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had killed my own father.</font>

143
00:12:13,040 --> 00:12:17,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that moment,
what I thought of myself was that...</font>

144
00:12:19,210 --> 00:12:20,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no, that is what I had to think.</font>

145
00:12:23,430 --> 00:12:26,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then knew that it was
the most painful thing.</font>

146
00:12:26,680 --> 00:12:29,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The most... painful thing...?</font>

147
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:31,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That I...</font>

148
00:12:31,850 --> 00:12:36,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that my existence didn't matter
to anyone else in the world.</font>

149
00:12:37,980 --> 00:12:40,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Same with me.</font>

150
00:12:40,780 --> 00:12:43,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You told me that...</font>

151
00:12:44,150 --> 00:12:48,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll be the best Ninja in the village,
and make everyone respect you.</font>

152
00:12:49,830 --> 00:12:54,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If someone comes along and
accepts you for who you are,</font>

153
00:12:54,160 --> 00:12:58,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no one could be more important
to you than that person.</font>

154
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:05,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though he knew I was from
a clan with Kekkei Genkai,</font>

155
00:13:05,300 --> 00:13:07,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zabuza-san took me in.</font>

156
00:13:08,350 --> 00:13:14,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My power that everyone hated...
He wanted it, needed it.</font>

157
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:22,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brats like you won't be needed
by anyone and die like dogs.</font>

158
00:13:27,160 --> 00:13:30,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have the same eyes
as I do...</font>

159
00:13:37,580 --> 00:13:38,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brat...</font>

160
00:13:39,540 --> 00:13:43,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you want...
to be needed by someone?</font>

161
00:13:45,380 --> 00:13:49,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you willing
to give everything for me?</font>

162
00:14:00,150 --> 00:14:04,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From now on,
your power belongs to me.</font>

163
00:14:19,120 --> 00:14:20,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come with me.</font>

164
00:14:26,380 --> 00:14:27,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was so happy...</font>

165
00:14:29,930 --> 00:14:31,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haku, bad news.</font>

166
00:14:33,100 --> 00:14:36,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to leave the Land of Water
as of tonight.</font>

167
00:14:37,940 --> 00:14:42,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, I'll be back in
this land some day.</font>

168
00:14:42,770 --> 00:14:45,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will rule over this land.</font>

169
00:14:45,900 --> 00:14:47,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To do that...</font>

170
00:14:47,740 --> 00:14:52,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">what I need isn't consolation,
encouragement or empty words.</font>

171
00:14:53,330 --> 00:14:55,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What I really need is...</font>

172
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:56,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I already know.</font>

173
00:14:56,410 --> 00:14:57,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have nothing to fear.</font>

174
00:14:58,210 --> 00:15:00,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am your weapon, Zabuza-san.</font>

175
00:15:00,620 --> 00:15:05,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Keep me by you as a mere tool
that heeds your every word.</font>

176
00:15:07,550 --> 00:15:08,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a good boy!</font>

177
00:15:11,010 --> 00:15:13,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I apologize, Zabuza-san.</font>

178
00:15:13,720 --> 00:15:17,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wasn't good enough to be
the tool you were looking for.</font>

179
00:15:26,650 --> 00:15:27,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun!</font>

180
00:15:30,110 --> 00:15:31,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want you...</font>

181
00:15:32,870 --> 00:15:34,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to kill me.</font>

182
00:15:42,120 --> 00:15:46,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art, Summoning,
Earth Style: Fanged Pursuit Jutsu!</font>

183
00:15:53,890 --> 00:15:56,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whatever you do won't work!</font>

184
00:15:56,430 --> 00:16:00,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have absolutely no idea
where I am now.</font>

185
00:16:00,270 --> 00:16:01,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

186
00:16:02,770 --> 00:16:06,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know exactly where you are
and what you're about.</font>

187
00:16:06,690 --> 00:16:07,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi...</font>

188
00:16:08,820 --> 00:16:12,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are completely
in my hands now.</font>

189
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:28,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What is that racket?</font>

190
00:16:29,130 --> 00:16:32,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What... Just what's going on out there?</font>

191
00:16:36,970 --> 00:16:39,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you can't use your eyes or ears,
simply use your nose.</font>

192
00:16:41,640 --> 00:16:42,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what happens</font>

193
00:16:42,940 --> 00:16:45,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when you're closing your eyes
in the midst of fog.</font>

194
00:16:45,940 --> 00:16:49,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the Summoning Jutsu
specialized for pursuit.</font>

195
00:16:51,030 --> 00:16:53,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I deliberately shed my own blood</font>

196
00:16:53,610 --> 00:16:56,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to stop your attacks both times
for this.</font>

197
00:16:56,820 --> 00:17:01,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your weapons have a thick scent of
my blood on them now.</font>

198
00:17:01,540 --> 00:17:05,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those are my adorable Ninja Dogs.</font>

199
00:17:05,330 --> 00:17:07,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And their sense of smell
is without equal.</font>

200
00:17:07,710 --> 00:17:10,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the one who
was playing into my hands.</font>

201
00:17:13,510 --> 00:17:15,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The fog has lifted already.</font>

202
00:17:16,090 --> 00:17:19,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And your future is...
death.</font>

203
00:17:21,100 --> 00:17:22,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've had enough of your bluffs!</font>

204
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:24,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't act tough!</font>

205
00:17:25,310 --> 00:17:28,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's nothing you can do
in this situation.</font>

206
00:17:28,900 --> 00:17:31,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your death is certain.</font>

207
00:17:33,280 --> 00:17:34,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zabuza.</font>

208
00:17:34,610 --> 00:17:36,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were too full of yourself.</font>

209
00:17:37,280 --> 00:17:39,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're too ambitious
for your own good.</font>

210
00:17:49,880 --> 00:17:54,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You assassinated the Mizukage,
but failed to pull off a coup.</font>

211
00:17:56,050 --> 00:17:58,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You left the service with
few men under you,</font>

212
00:17:58,550 --> 00:18:00,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and became a Rogue Ninja.</font>

213
00:18:03,060 --> 00:18:05,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Soon after, your name reached
our Hidden Leaf Village.</font>

214
00:18:06,350 --> 00:18:08,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You needed to raise funds
to strike back.</font>

215
00:18:08,900 --> 00:18:10,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you needed to hide from</font>

216
00:18:10,770 --> 00:18:12,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Tracking Unit's
pursuit and retaliation.</font>

217
00:18:13,030 --> 00:18:14,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't that about the reason</font>

218
00:18:14,650 --> 00:18:18,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">why you hired yourself out
to scum like Gato?</font>

219
00:18:19,530 --> 00:18:20,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zabuza.</font>

220
00:18:20,570 --> 00:18:24,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you really believe I've managed
to survive with just Sharingan?</font>

221
00:18:26,120 --> 00:18:30,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here's something I didn't copy,
a Jutsu of my own...</font>

222
00:18:31,750 --> 00:18:33,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To enlighten you!</font>

223
00:18:46,890 --> 00:18:47,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lightning Blade!</font>

224
00:18:48,810 --> 00:18:49,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?!</font>

225
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:53,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His hand is visibly overflowing
with Chakra!</font>

226
00:18:56,610 --> 00:18:58,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are too dangerous.</font>

227
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:02,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tazuna-san, the man you are trying
to assassinate</font>

228
00:19:02,120 --> 00:19:03,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is the symbol of courage in this land!</font>

229
00:19:04,580 --> 00:19:08,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The bridge he is building
is the hope of this land!</font>

230
00:19:08,710 --> 00:19:11,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And your ambitions will sacrifice
countless lives.</font>

231
00:19:12,790 --> 00:19:16,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That isn't how a Shinobi
is supposed to behave.</font>

232
00:19:17,460 --> 00:19:18,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who cares?</font>

233
00:19:20,470 --> 00:19:23,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have always fought
for my own ideals.</font>

234
00:19:24,970 --> 00:19:28,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that will never ever change!</font>

235
00:19:32,310 --> 00:19:33,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll say it again.</font>

236
00:19:34,110 --> 00:19:34,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

237
00:19:35,440 --> 00:19:36,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give up.</font>

238
00:19:40,450 --> 00:19:43,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your future is...
death!</font>

239
00:19:45,160 --> 00:19:46,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please kill me.</font>

240
00:19:49,200 --> 00:19:51,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you hesitating for?</font>

241
00:19:52,460 --> 00:19:53,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

242
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:56,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What you said is ridiculous!</font>

243
00:19:57,050 --> 00:19:59,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a weapon?
Just a tool for him?</font>

244
00:19:59,800 --> 00:20:02,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How can you call him
special to you?</font>

245
00:20:02,680 --> 00:20:05,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you really okay with that?</font>

246
00:20:07,100 --> 00:20:08,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that wrong?</font>

247
00:20:08,470 --> 00:20:09,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

248
00:20:10,100 --> 00:20:12,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tell me, what is wrong with that?</font>

249
00:20:12,810 --> 00:20:13,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, uh...</font>

250
00:20:14,400 --> 00:20:15,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not...</font>

251
00:20:16,610 --> 00:20:20,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zabuza-san counts on me,
even if I'm worthless.</font>

252
00:20:21,450 --> 00:20:23,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He made me feel needed.</font>

253
00:20:54,480 --> 00:20:59,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But now, I've lost my usefulness
that affirmed my existence.</font>

254
00:21:00,570 --> 00:21:04,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zabuza-san no longer needs me.</font>

255
00:21:08,450 --> 00:21:11,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why,
I am now appealing to you.</font>

256
00:21:14,750 --> 00:21:17,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please, make it quick</font>

257
00:21:33,400 --> 00:21:36,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Cultivate your hunger before you idealize.</font></b></font></font></font>

258
00:21:36,780 --> 00:21:40,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Motivate your anger to make them all realize.</font></b></font></font></font>

259
00:21:40,240 --> 00:21:43,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Climbing the mountain, never coming down.</font></b></font></font></font>

260
00:21:43,410 --> 00:21:47,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Break into the contents, never falling down.</font></b></font></font></font>

261
00:21:50,590 --> 00:21:53,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">My knee is still shaking, like I was twelve.</font></b></font></font></font>

262
00:21:53,840 --> 00:21:57,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Sneaking out of the classroom, by the back door.</font></b></font></font></font>

263
00:21:57,180 --> 00:22:00,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">A man railed at me twice though, but I didn't care.</font></b></font></font></font>

264
00:22:00,640 --> 00:22:04,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Waiting is wasting for people like me.</font></b></font></font></font>

265
00:22:04,310 --> 00:22:07,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

266
00:22:07,310 --> 00:22:10,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

267
00:22:10,770 --> 00:22:14,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

268
00:22:14,360 --> 00:22:17,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">'Cause you will hate yourself in the end.</font></b></font></font></font>

269
00:22:27,330 --> 00:22:30,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

270
00:22:30,670 --> 00:22:34,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

271
00:22:34,050 --> 00:22:37,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

272
00:22:37,380 --> 00:22:41,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">'Cause you will hate yourself in the end.</font></b></font></font></font>

273
00:22:41,010 --> 00:22:44,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

274
00:22:44,470 --> 00:22:47,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

275
00:22:47,770 --> 00:22:50,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't dry...</font></b></font></font></font>

276
00:22:51,930 --> 00:22:55,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">W-Why did this happen?</font>

277
00:22:56,430 --> 00:23:00,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Is this what it means to
be a strong Shinobi?</font>

278
00:23:00,520 --> 00:23:02,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">To protect someone?</font>

279
00:23:03,320 --> 00:23:05,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Are you okay with that?</font>

280
00:23:05,280 --> 00:23:07,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Are you really okay with that?</font>

281
00:23:08,650 --> 00:23:12,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I don't get it.
I can never accept that!</font>

282
00:23:15,040 --> 00:23:18,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next episode:
"A Tool Known as a Shinobi."</font>

